+## Changelog
+
+**Bulk folder adding for the Jukebox**
+- The **Add Folder…** button in the Jukebox tab now lets you select multiple folders at once instead of adding them one at a time. All selected folders are added in a single operation, with one summary announcement reporting how many were added.
+
+**Mark and remove multiple items (Favourites, Liked Songs, Audio Books, Jukebox)**
+- In the Favourites, Liked Songs, Audio Books library, and Jukebox lists, you can now mark multiple items before removing them: press `.` to mark/unmark the highlighted item (marked rows are labelled "(marked)"), then press `Delete` or use the **Remove Selected** context-menu command to remove every marked item at once, after a single confirmation dialog. See [Marking and Removing Multiple Items](#marking-and-removing-multiple-items) under Favourites for details.
